00:15:02,360 --> 00:15:04,080
Everyone at the art center knows that.

284
00:15:04,200 --> 00:15:05,200
This isn't a secret.

285
00:15:05,520 --> 00:15:06,840
So you've already anticipated

286
00:15:06,880 --> 00:15:08,280
what Nightblade would deduce.

287
00:15:08,520 --> 00:15:10,560
By throwing out the bait Jin Junyi,

288
00:15:11,440 --> 00:15:12,840
we can backtrack to him.

289
00:15:15,760 --> 00:15:17,560
This is a risky move.

290
00:15:18,000 --> 00:15:20,000
If we fail to intercept Nightblade,

291
00:15:20,480 --> 00:15:22,400
we must retrieve Jin Junyi.

292
00:15:22,800 --> 00:15:24,800
He is Rick's illegitimate son,

293
00:15:24,880 --> 00:15:27,200
and he's been coveting your daughter Liluo for a long time.

294
00:15:27,240 --> 00:15:28,920
We cannot let him die.

295
00:15:30,120 --> 00:15:31,600
Let's wait and see.

296
00:15:32,640 --> 00:15:34,160
Song Ke, come out with me.

297
00:15:34,360 --> 00:15:36,680
We'll confuse the opponent through rapid movement.

298
00:15:37,080 --> 00:15:39,640
Soon we'll be able to backtrack to the location

299
00:15:39,680 --> 00:15:40,720
of the bastion host.

300
00:15:41,280 --> 00:15:42,280
Be careful.

301
00:15:42,880 --> 00:15:45,520
Xiaoquan and I are awaiting the results of the tracking.

302
00:15:46,240 --> 00:15:47,160
After you pinpoint the location,

303
00:15:47,200 --> 00:15:48,640
quickly erase all traces of the intrusion.

304
00:15:49,200 --> 00:15:51,880
The principle of our ISA

305
00:15:52,160 --> 00:15:54,440
is, first and foremost, absolute self-preservation.

306
00:15:55,480 --> 00:15:58,880
Yan Sir, you and Mr. Xiaoquan must be extremely careful.

307
00:16:15,760 --> 00:16:17,480
Boss, the location has changed.

308
00:16:17,600 --> 00:16:19,840
It's moving from Heisongpo towards the coastal cliffs.

309
00:16:20,360 --> 00:16:21,160
They're moving?

310
00:16:21,640 --> 00:16:22,600
Quite meticulous!

311
00:16:23,200 --> 00:16:24,080
Keep observing.

312
00:16:24,600 --> 00:16:25,240
Xiaoquan.

313
00:16:25,800 --> 00:16:26,520
Dawn's breaking.

314
00:16:26,760 --> 00:16:27,560
Let's head back to the hospital.
